        <mxCell id="notes" value='&lt;b&gt;Notes&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;*1 &lt;b&gt;Origin is the dividing line&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Managed services need Internet origin; compute inside a VPC uses VPC origin. The origin cannot be changed after creation.&lt;br&gt;*2 &lt;b&gt;What is not drawn is not "unsupported"&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;AWS DataSync, AWS Backup, Amazon Macie, Amazon GuardDuty, AWS Storage Gateway and others: no public statement was found. The table in the text lists what was searched.&lt;br&gt;*3 &lt;b&gt;The basis differs per row&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;The table in the text separates AWS documentation, measurements in this and other repositories, and vendor-published statements.' style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;strokeColor=#FFFFFF;fillColor=none;fontColor=#FFFFFF;fontSize=16;verticalAlign=top;align=left;spacingLeft=10;spacingRight=10;spacingTop=8;" vertex="1" parent="1">
